Affairs. The eighth king, Gao Bogu, governed ineptly, plunging the state into chaos. After Gao Nanwu succeeded to the throne, he sought to summon Yan Liu to court to reform the administration. Yan Liu modestly declined, citing that ‘Your humble servant is mediocre and foolish, certainly unfit to participate in major affairs of state,’ and instead recommended the worthy talent Yi Basu (who was once a farmer and was later appointed Prime Minister).","jp":"高句麗の大臣で、官位は国政。第8代国王の高伯固は治世に長けず、国を混乱に陥れた。高男武が即位すると、朝政を立て直すべく晏留を召し出して朝廷に留めようとしたが、晏留は「微臣は愚鈍にして、もとより大政に参与するに足らず」と謙虚に固辞し、代わって賢才の乙巴素（かつて農夫であったが、後に重用されて宰相となる）を推挙した。","kr":"고구려의 대신으로, 국정을 관장했습니다. 제8대 왕 고백고가 국정을 제대로 다스리지 못해 나라가 혼란에 빠지자, 고남무가 즉위한 뒤 조정을 쇄신하고자 안류를 불러들여 조정에 머물게 하려 했습니다. 그러나 안류는 '소신은 우둔하여 본디 대정에 참여하기에 부족합니다'라며 겸손히 사양하고, 어진 인재인 을파소(농부 출신이었으나 훗날 재상으로 중용됨)를 대신 천거했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1053215","remark":"","surname":"晏","surnameTc":"晏","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"晏","surnameKr":"안","surnameOther":"","name":"留","nameTc":"留","nameEn":"Liu","nameJp":"留","nameKr":"유","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"晏留","power":"WJ1010002","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1067","gender":"0","rule":"56","force":"45","wise":"73","politics":"75","charm":"76","will":"72","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"11","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"21/20/20/22/20/73/27/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1020505","debateSoul":"1000205","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"3000","debateSoulPoint":"6800","strategy":"1000908","strategy2":"1002205","professions":"3/2/2/3/2/0/2/2/4/2/2/2/